('ic_timeline_reliability_70', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'Timeline Reliability', 'experiential', 70, 'Cross-Functional Milestone Tracker', 'Act as milestone tracker for a cross-functional project for two weeks, synthesizing Friday status updates.', 'What patterns emerged in how peers estimated capacity versus actual output?', 'Project Lead', 'Sprint Cycle', 'Formally announce the employee''s temporary tracking role to the project team to establish authority and ensure compliance.', 'In our next bi-weekly check-in, let''s review your first Friday milestone synthesis together to calibrate tone and cross-functional expectations.'),
