('ic_timeline_reliability_10', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'Timeline Reliability', 'formal', 10, 'Agile Estimation Foundations', 'Complete a foundational module on Agile sprint planning and velocity tracking.', 'Where does your task management deviate most significantly from established Agile principles?', 'Agile Framework', 'Self-Paced Module', 'Formally announce the employee''s temporary tracking role to the project team to establish authority and ensure compliance.', 'In our next bi-weekly check-in, let''s review your first Friday milestone synthesis together to calibrate tone and cross-functional expectations.'),
('ic_high_quality_delivery_70', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'High-Quality Delivery', 'experiential', 70, 'Formal Pre-Flight Self-QA Checklist', 'Implement a formal ''self-QA'' checklist before submitting your next three major deliverables.', 'Which recurring error did this checklist catch before it reached the broader team?', 'Quality Assurance', 'Pre-Submission Protocol', 'Allocate an extra 10% buffer time to the employee''s next deadline specifically designated for comprehensive self-review.', 'Which recurring error caught by your self-QA checklist surprised you most, and how can we turn that check into a team-wide standard?'),
('ic_high_quality_delivery_20', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'High-Quality Delivery', 'social', 20, 'Mutual High-Detail Peer Review', 'Partner with a peer known for high attention to detail and conduct a mutual review of each other''s work prior to final submission.', 'What specific formatting or structural choice did your peer make that you can adopt? What did you see in their work that you could emulate?', 'Peer Review', 'Partner Exchange', 'Allocate an extra 10% buffer time to the employee''s next deadline specifically designated for comprehensive self-review.', 'Which recurring error caught by your self-QA checklist surprised you most, and how can we turn that check into a team-wide standard?'),
('ic_high_quality_delivery_10', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'High-Quality Delivery', 'formal', 10, 'Lean Six Sigma Mistake-Proofing (Poka-Yoke)', 'Read an article or module on Lean Six Sigma principles related to defect reduction in knowledge work.', 'How can you apply the concept of ''poka-yoke'' (mistake-proofing) to your daily routine?', 'Lean Methodology', 'Defect Reduction', 'Allocate an extra 10% buffer time to the employee''s next deadline specifically designated for comprehensive self-review.', 'Which recurring error caught by your self-QA checklist surprised you most, and how can we turn that check into a team-wide standard?'),
('ic_execution_efficiency_70', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'Execution Efficiency', 'experiential', 70, 'Calendar Audit & Async Optimization', 'Audit your calendar for the next two weeks and decline or propose async alternatives for any meeting where you aren''t an active contributor.', 'How many hours were reclaimed, and how were they reallocated?', 'Time Management', 'Schedule Streamlining', 'Support the employee in declining non-essential meetings and formally approve their proposed asynchronous communication channels.', 'How many reclaimed hours were you able to convert into uninterrupted deep work this week, and how can I help protect those blocks?'),
('ic_execution_efficiency_20', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'Execution Efficiency', 'social', 20, 'Productivity Champion Shadowing', 'Shadow a highly productive peer for half a day to observe how they manage their inbox, task list, and context-switching.', 'What boundary-setting technique did they use that you often struggle with?', 'Peer Shadowing', 'Workflow Observation', 'Support the employee in declining non-essential meetings and formally approve their proposed asynchronous communication channels.', 'How many reclaimed hours were you able to convert into uninterrupted deep work this week, and how can I help protect those blocks?'),
('ic_execution_efficiency_10', 'ic', 'Action Orientation', 'Execution Efficiency', 'formal', 10, 'Deep Work & Eisenhower Prioritization', 'Review the Eisenhower Matrix or ''Deep Work'' principles for prioritizing high-impact tasks.', 'Which quadrant of the matrix do you default to when feeling overwhelmed?', 'Focus Framework', 'Task Prioritization', 'Support the employee in declining non-essential meetings and formally approve their proposed asynchronous communication channels.', 'How many reclaimed hours were you able to convert into uninterrupted deep work this week, and how can I help protect those blocks?'),
('ic_active_listening_70', 'ic', 'Collaborative Communication', 'Active Listening', 'experiential', 70, 'The 3-Voice Pause Technique', 'In your next three meetings, intentionally wait to speak until at least three others have shared perspectives.', 'What new ideas or points of view did this surface that might have otherwise been missed?', 'Meeting Practice', 'Team Syncs', 'Privately suggest two safe, constructive peers the employee could approach for the feedback exercise and encourage their participation.', 'What differences did you notice in group energy or engagement when you held back from speaking first?'),
