('ic_constructive_teaming_20', 'ic', 'Collaborative Communication', 'Constructive Teaming', 'social', 20, 'Team Recognition & Kudos Facilitation', 'Facilitate a brief ''kudos'' segment at the start of your next team meeting, explicitly recognizing the hidden work of two peers.', 'How did acknowledging others'' contributions impact the group''s overall energy?', 'Recognition Ritual', 'Team Meeting', 'Delegate a small, low-risk collaborative task entirely to this employee and a peer they need to build better rapport with.', 'How did stepping in to support your peer shift the collaboration dynamic, and what can we do to keep that momentum going?'),
