('ic_practical_solutions_70', 'ic', 'Problem Solving', 'Practical Solutions', 'experiential', 70, 'Workflow Automation / Template Sprint', 'Identify one recurring manual task and build a basic automation, template, or checklist to resolve it this week.', 'How many hours per month will this fix save for you and the broader team?', 'Quick Win', 'Operational Lean', 'Protect two hours of the employee''s schedule this week strictly dedicated to building and testing their workflow automation.', 'Where else in the department could this template or automation be leveraged once validated?'),
