('ic_roadblock_diagnosis_70', 'ic', 'Problem Solving', 'Roadblock Diagnosis', 'experiential', 70, 'Visual Workflow Bottleneck Mapping', 'The next time a process stalls, map the exact workflow on a whiteboard or virtual canvas to identify the specific step where the breakdown occurred, before proposing a fix.', 'Did the visual map reveal a different root cause than your initial assumption?', 'Process Mapping', 'Visual Diagnostics', 'During the next 1-on-1, resist giving the employee the answer to a blocker; instead, ask them to visually step through the issue with you.', 'When you stepped through the workflow map, what structural variable surfaced that wasn''t visible in the initial post-mortem?'),
('ic_roadblock_diagnosis_20', 'ic', 'Problem Solving', 'Roadblock Diagnosis', 'social', 20, '5 Whys Root-Cause Facilitation', 'Facilitate a ''5 Whys'' root-cause analysis session with a small group of peers regarding a recent project delay.', 'At which ''Why'' did the team''s consensus start to fracture?', 'Root Cause Analysis', 'Peer Retrospective', 'During the next 1-on-1, resist giving the employee the answer to a blocker; instead, ask them to visually step through the issue with you.', 'When you stepped through the workflow map, what structural variable surfaced that wasn''t visible in the initial post-mortem?'),
('ic_roadblock_diagnosis_10', 'ic', 'Problem Solving', 'Roadblock Diagnosis', 'formal', 10, 'Systems Thinking: Symptoms vs. Root Causes', 'Complete a brief module on Systems Thinking and distinguishing between symptoms and root causes.', 'Which recurring team complaint is actually just a symptom of a deeper structural issue?', 'Systems Thinking', 'Diagnostic Framework', 'During the next 1-on-1, resist giving the employee the answer to a blocker; instead, ask them to visually step through the issue with you.', 'When you stepped through the workflow map, what structural variable surfaced that wasn''t visible in the initial post-mortem?'),
