('ic_scoped_execution_20', 'ic', 'Problem Solving', 'Scoped Execution', 'social', 20, 'Scope Negotiation & Boundary Playbook', 'Interview a project manager or senior IC about how they gracefully say ''no'' to scope creep without alienating stakeholders.', 'What specific phrasing can you adopt to protect your operational boundaries?', 'Mentorship', 'Tactical Inquiry', 'Act as an escalation point to defend the employee''s defined scope if stakeholders attempt to bypass the agreed-upon boundaries.', 'What stakeholder pressures challenged your ''out-of-scope'' list, and how can I reinforce your boundaries in project steering reviews?'),
