('director_narrative_framing_70', 'director', 'Stakeholder Influence', 'Narrative Framing', 'experiential', 70, 'Business-Impact C-Suite Reframe', 'Take a highly technical or operational update and completely reframe it as a business-impact narrative before presenting it to your team or the C-suite.', 'How did removing the operational "how" change the audience’s reaction to the "what"?', 'Executive Framing', 'C-Suite Briefing', 'Block time to review the director''s narrative structure before their next major stakeholder presentation, focusing strictly on framing rather than facts.', 'As you reframed your operational update into business impact, what detail was hardest to cut, and let''s review the narrative arc together before your next pitch?'),
