('director_capability_modeling_70', 'director', 'Talent Architecture', 'Capability Modeling', 'experiential', 70, '24-Month Strategic Capability Gap Map', 'Map the department''s current skill sets against the 3-year strategic roadmap to identify specific capabilities to hire or cultivate in the next 24 months.', 'What current capability will become obsolete first, and what is the transition plan to cultivate its alternative?', 'Capability Mapping', '3-Year Roadmap', 'Critically discuss headcount requests that are specifically earmarked for future capabilities rather than immediate operational relief.', 'Which emerging capability on your 24-month map carries the highest strategic risk if we delay hiring, and how should we ring-fence headcount for it now?'),
