('director_org_design_70', 'director', 'Talent Architecture', 'Org Design', 'experiential', 70, 'Anti-Silo Departmental Restructure Proposal', 'Draft a proposal to restructure a sub-set of your department to eliminate systemic silos or rethink historical reporting preferences.', 'How much of your current org chart is built around legacy personalities rather than business logic?', 'Org Restructuring', 'Structural Proposal', 'Protect the director from political blowback when they propose structural changes that will improve the health of the broader enterprise.', 'Where is our current reporting structure reflecting legacy habits instead of business logic, and what political friction should I prepare to absorb as you propose changes?'),
